WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Sister Xue

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,800
The school has no rivals

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,400
You are quite strong

4
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,520
It’s pretty crazy. I have no opponents in the first grade.

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,560
You won't challenge yourself

6
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:09,920
Master Basson’s seniors

7
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:10,880
Not often at school

8
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,240
You sophomores have been a lot busy lately

9
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,320
Our teacher said

10
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,840
Save me from going to the senior wilderness

11
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:15,800
Why are you so busy as a sophomore?

12
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,200
You never mentioned it

13
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:21,220
If you don’t want to be swept away by you, why don’t you add me as a friend?

14
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,060
We can practice together if we have the opportunity in the future.

15
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,420
That little girl who graduated from class

16
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,660
It's your classmate

17
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:35,330
Tianwei will be Class A soon, right?

18
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:37,730
Her mecha is good

19
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:40,430
Of course

20
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:43,030
The mecha designed by Tianwei is super level

21
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:44,470
And she made that mecha

22
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:46,030
It only took a week
